    <title>Vol.4 她在深夜的网约车里收集人间故事</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/632571a4aafc5c394512ddb3</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">632571a4aafc5c394512ddb3</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 17 Sep 2022 07:05:08 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>她是互联网产品经理，每次下班坐网约车的时候都会和司机攀谈，这些司机有人开过赌场，有人做过夜场少爷，有人曾在山西挖煤，还有人透露自己老婆出轨，她用手机录音现场的对话内容，进行人间观察，并制作成了播客。我们请到她聊了聊，发现这样一位善于观察人间的女生还有催眠疗愈以及占卜的神奇技能。</span></p><span></span><h2><span>嘉宾介绍</span></h2><span></span><p><span>Surrender，播客「</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/60f42b33333b09056038c5c6" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/60f42b33333b09056038c5c6"><span>深夜网约车</span></a><span>」主理人。</span></p><span></span><p><span>这期引用到的 Surrender 的节目：</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6282669d4070a48aa1b57a68" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6282669d4070a48aa1b57a68"><span>《司机故事｜我曾在杭州开赌场》</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/627d175766a73a906e2940ca" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/627d175766a73a906e2940ca"><span>《司机故事｜怎么在夜场赚到更多的钱》</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/628f91e65cf4a5ad60ca0c07" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/628f91e65cf4a5ad60ca0c07"><span>《司机故事｜我在陕西挖煤》</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/627a7e7c0c2b7867837af92b" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/627a7e7c0c2b7867837af92b"><span>《司机故事｜电视剧里的事都让我遇到了》</span></a></p><span></span><h2><span>节目制作</span></h2><span></span><p><span>主播：江洋、斯睿</span></p><span></span><p><span>后期：斯睿</span></p><span></span><p><span>开头配乐：Sangre De Muerdago - 53º 40,6 N 008º 06,3 E</span></p><span></span><p><span>中间配乐：Chinese Football - 电动少女</span></p><span></span><p><span>结尾配乐：Chinese Football - 漂流人间</span></p><span></span><h2><span>关于节目</span></h2><span></span><p><span>「朝阳路5号」是一档对谈类独立播客。聚焦于“闪光的普通人”，呈现 Ta 们有价值的经验和思考，领域涉及科技，职场，商业，社会人文。</span></p>]]></description>
